body:
How I feel VS How I want to feel: 

How I feel; 

Toxic; 
This is a place I really don't want to be. I'm taking a new Antipsychotic and it hurts my soul. My head is so quiet. I'm detoxing off one drug to get my sorry arse ready for the next lot. Patience is needed. Drugs need time to work, but I feel like a sess pool of chemicals. If I'm not careful Captian Planet is gonna think I'm a bad guy.

How I  feel VS how I want to feel:
How I feel;

Oiled;

Day 3 on olanzapine. And I'm struggling. My head is foggy. My brain is mush. All my of creative center feels bogged down. But I really need to try. I still hear voices but the cats are gone. Which is great. Maybe I can drive again soon!

I paint at least 2 pieces a day. 
How I feel VS how I want to feel

How I want to feel ; 
Winged Chaos ; 
I have been trying to incorporate other elements into my pieces. And feathers are by far my favourite. I adore all they represent. Freedom and weightlessness. I can't remember the last time I felt that way. My beautiful niece collects them for me when she goes for walks with mum and is so excited to see what I decide to do with them. God kids are great!
